-- Workflow fixtures (parity/scenarios/workflows). Loaded after base.sql.
--
-- Swift limits /v1/workflows with workflowsByUser, 60 a minute scaled by tier (free
-- and lapsed 20, trial 60, pro 120, ultimate 240). Each scenario file has its own
-- users so no bucket fills, which would make the run depend on the clock.
--
-- Webhook secrets are SecretBox values for the parity LV_SECRET_MASTER_KEY, sealed
-- with this tenant's id, of the plain text "parity-hook-secret".


